# pop'n music 9, a KONAMI ID made on the cabinet, with --autoplay. After popn9-card-new.his (same
# --nvram; phase 0): the card (PIN 1234), NORMAL, three songs played by the game, the staff roll;
# then, as the card has no KONAMI ID (userid.ctou 112), INFORMATION "KONAMI IDのご案内". Blue 4 x2
# moves from 登録を中止する to 新規発行; the ID "hiraku09" on the character wheel (blue 6/4 turn it, it
# starts on "a"; red picks; 決定 is item 0x2a), the password 5678 twice on the 10-key ->
# userid.adduser user="hiraku09" pass="5678" card=..., and "「KONAMI ID」と「PASSWORD」が登録されました".
# The menu comes about 450 frames after the mode (0x25a0d8) turns 0xc (36,647 here).
#   hiraku-popn9 --autoplay --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn9-konamiid-new.his
game popn9
watch mode u32 0x25a0d8
at 4500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4540 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5050 press "Card" 8
at 5400 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 5430 press "Keypad 2" 8
at 5460 press "Keypad 3" 8
